  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen minimizing the navigation panel of a Tab in the Main Menu, the animation for the text \"flying out\" is different between the Header / Title of the Tab, the buttons (e.g. Current Avatar / Current World) and the different Categories.\n\nThe header and button text does a fade out animation, while the categories slide out to the left.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nAll the text in the navigation panel should have the same fly in / fly out animation when minimizing the navigation panel.\n\nI think it would be the best if they would all use the fading in / out animation as it looks better than the text just flying out to the side.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: \n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/fd2xoh.mp4",
